    "Add actions to your speed dial — photo prompts, smart home controls, shortcuts, and more." : {
      "comment" : "A description below the \"No Quick Actions\" message in the Quick Actions Settings view, explaining that users can add actions to their speed dial.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
